{
  "_implementation_notes": [
    "CELADON CITY -- Phase 2 (Complication deepens). Maps 95, 414, 405, 413, 432-436.",
    "Tone: Dark Satire. Luxurious surface, collective complicity underneath.",
    "Everyone knows the Game Corner is a Rocket front. Nobody says it out loud.",
    "Erika is pragmatic, serene, deliberately evasive -- not villainous.",
    "",
    "Map 414 EV009 (Erika): Full pre-battle rewrite + post-battle choice.",
    "THE CHOICE is implemented via insert_commands after badge/TM at index 50.",
    "Sets Variable 344 (SYNTH_ERIKA_CHOICE) and Switches 1147-1149.",
    "NOTE: Switches 1147-1149 / Var 344 per task spec. Verify no conflict",
    "with Victory Road allocations before final integration.",
    "",
    "Erika post-battle reads Switch 1132 (SYNTH_MISTY_REFORMIST) and",
    "Switch 1133 (SYNTH_MISTY_CAUTIOUS) for conditional callback lines.",
    "",
    "Map 405 (Game Corner): Mechanical events preserved -- slot machines,",
    "coin pickups, prize exchange, poster/switch mechanic, coin purchase.",
    "Only NPC flavor text rewritten.",
    "",
    "Map 95: Sewer entries, Erika cutscene (EV070/071), police event (EV084),",
    "Rocket smuggling (EV085), sign posts, and mechanical events ALL preserved.",
    "Only standalone NPC dialogue rewritten for Synthesis tone.",
    "",
    "Map 413 (Route 7): Trainers, trade NPC, move tutor, Growlithe quest,",
    "vending machines, and Sabrina darkness events ALL preserved mechanically.",
    "Only trainer pre/post-battle flavor and standalone NPC lines rewritten.",
    "",
    "Maps 432-436 (Dept Store): Light touch only. Shop mechanics, TM delivery",
    "quest, vending machines, Sinnoh clothes quest, Sabrina events -- ALL preserved.",
    "Only 1-2 flavor NPCs per floor rewritten.",
    "",
    "Line length limit: ~42 characters per line for RPG Maker XP text box."
  ],
  "maps": {
    "95": {
      "name": "Celadon City",
      "events": {
        "21": {
          "name": "EV021 (Resident -- Game Corner Opinion)",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Everyone knows the Game Corner",
                    "is run by... certain people.",
                    "But it funds the gardens, the",
                    "roads, the whole east side."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 3,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "You learn not to ask where",
                    "the money comes from."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "19": {
          "name": "EV019 (Resident -- Koffing Owner)",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I got my Koffing from a guy",
                    "near the Game Corner. Didn't",
                    "ask questions. Great price."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 3,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "It breathes poison when it's",
                    "angry, but hey -- so does",
                    "this city, metaphorically."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "17": {
          "name": "EV017 (Resident -- Politoed Owner)",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "This is my Politoed! Raised it",
                    "myself, no fusion, no shortcuts."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 3,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Not everyone in Celadon takes",
                    "the easy way. Just... most."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "7": {
          "name": "EV007 (Resident -- Sewer Comment)",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "The sewers dried up last month.",
                    "Someone's been building down",
                    "there. Infrastructure, they say."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "13": {
          "name": "EV013 (Resident -- Saw Strange Men)",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I've seen people in dark suits",
                    "going into the sewers at night.",
                    "Reported it once. Officer said",
                    "it was 'authorized maintenance.'"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 4,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Authorized. Right."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "22": {
          "name": "EV022 (Garden NPC -- Item Gift)",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Lovely day, isn't it? Erika's",
                    "gardens are the pride of Kanto.",
                    "Here -- take this. A gift for",
                    "anyone who appreciates beauty."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 3,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Here's a gift for dropping by!"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "1": {
              "conditions": {"self_switch": "A"},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "The gardens attract wild Eevee",
                    "sometimes. Erika says they're",
                    "drawn to places where people",
                    "are content. Or complacent."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "5": {
          "name": "EV005 (Suspicious Man / Sewer Entry)",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "What are you looking at? I'm",
                    "waiting for a... delivery."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 3,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Mind your business and I'll",
                    "mind mine. That's how Celadon",
                    "works."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "23": {
          "name": "EV023 (Cafe Tipster)",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {"switch1_id": 14},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 2,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "So, what's the special in the",
                    "backroom tonight? The usual",
                    "'imports'?"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 7,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Want a tip, kid?"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 9,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "The cafe sells more than coffee",
                    "after hours. Everyone knows.",
                    "The police know. Erika knows.",
                    "It's Celadon's worst-kept secret."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "414": {
      "name": "Celadon City Gym",
      "events": {
        "5": {
          "name": "Trainer(3) -- Gym Trainer (Sprouts)",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 6,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Erika says a good trainer",
                    "harmonizes with their Pok\u00e9mon.",
                    "Forcing a fusion is like forcing",
                    "a flower to bloom."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "1": {
              "conditions": {"self_switch": "A"},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Erika will set you straight.",
                    "She always does. Gracefully."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "2": {
              "conditions": {"switch1_id": 7},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 2,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "That was extraordinary. I've",
                    "never seen Erika lose composure."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 5,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "...She didn't, did she."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "6": {
          "name": "Trainer(3) -- Gym Trainer (Hobbyist)",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 5,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Pleased to meet you. I train",
                    "here because Erika values",
                    "patience over power. It's",
                    "refreshing. And convenient."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "1": {
              "conditions": {"self_switch": "A"},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Erika is quiet, but don't",
                    "mistake silence for ignorance.",
                    "She knows everything that",
                    "happens in this city."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "1": {
          "name": "Trainer(4) -- Gym Trainer (Gatekeeper)",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 5,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Nobody gets to Erika without",
                    "going through us. She values",
                    "her peace. We protect it."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "1": {
              "conditions": {"self_switch": "A"},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "We only use \\V[5]-type Pok\u00e9mon",
                    "here. Grass grows in any soil,",
                    "even poisoned soil."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 3,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Erika taught us that."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "7": {
          "name": "Trainer(3) -- Gym Trainer (Fire Warning)",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 5,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Leave the fire types outside.",
                    "This gym is a sanctuary. We",
                    "don't bring destruction in here."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "1": {
              "conditions": {"self_switch": "A"},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Erika says balance is natural.",
                    "Even the weeds have a purpose.",
                    "Even the parasites."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "2": {
              "conditions": {"switch1_id": 7},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 3,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "You earned the Rainbow Badge.",
                    "Erika doesn't give those to",
                    "people she doesn't respect."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 7,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "What a battle."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "2": {
          "name": "Trainer(3) -- Gym Trainer (Easy to Raise)",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 14,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "\\V[5]-type Pok\u00e9mon are patient.",
                    "They grow slowly, but they",
                    "endure. Like this city."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "1": {
              "conditions": {"self_switch": "A"},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "You know, I used to question",
                    "things more. Then I realized",
                    "how nice the garden is when",
                    "you just... stop asking."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "8": {
          "name": "Trainer(3) -- Gym Trainer (Mother)",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 5,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Grow strong, my darlings.",
                    "Celadon's soil is rich. Don't",
                    "ask what fertilizes it."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "1": {
              "conditions": {"self_switch": "A"},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I didn't bring my best team.",
                    "Erika says we should always",
                    "hold something back."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "2": {
              "conditions": {"switch1_id": 7},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 3,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "You beat Erika! That takes",
                    "real skill."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 7,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "She seemed almost... relieved?"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "3": {
          "name": "Trainer(3) -- Gym Trainer (Bored)",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 5,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Finally, someone new. It's so",
                    "quiet in here. Peaceful, Erika",
                    "says. I say stifling."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "1": {
              "conditions": {"self_switch": "A"},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Grass beats water and rock.",
                    "It also grows over anything",
                    "you bury. Remember that."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 3,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "It's a metaphor. For Celadon."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "4": {
          "name": "Trainer(2) -- Gym Trainer (Entrance Guard)",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 5,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "You're not one of the usual",
                    "gawkers, are you? Erika gets",
                    "a lot of visitors who just",
                    "want to see the flowers."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "1": {
              "conditions": {"self_switch": "A"},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "You're the real thing. Good.",
                    "Erika needs a real challenge",
                    "once in a while."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "9": {
          "name": "Erika",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 10,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Welcome to Celadon. Our city",
                    "prides itself on balance --",
                    "between nature and progress,",
                    "tradition and innovation."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 13,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "...Oh, forgive me. I was",
                    "contemplating the lilies.",
                    "They bloom regardless of what",
                    "happens around them."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 16,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "You've come to challenge me.",
                    "I can see it in your posture.",
                    "Purposeful. Impatient, even."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 18,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Pok\u00e9mon fusion is simply",
                    "another expression of balance,",
                    "when practiced with care. The",
                    "garden needs both sun and rain."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 21,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I shall use three Pok\u00e9mon.",
                    "Choose yours carefully."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 36,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "The Rainbow Badge lets traded",
                    "Pok\u00e9mon up to Level 50 obey.",
                    "It also grants the use of",
                    "Strength outside of battle."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 40,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Please, take this as well."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 43,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "TM22 -- Solarbeam. A beam of",
                    "concentrated light. No charge",
                    "needed when the sun shines."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 46,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "You fought honestly. That is",
                    "rarer than you might think",
                    "in this city."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 50,
                  "type": "insert_commands",
                  "_comment": "Erika deflects -- player can push back or accept. Sets Var 344 (SYNTH_ERIKA_CHOICE) + Switches 1147-1149. Choice: accept her philosophy, challenge the corruption, or express ambivalence.",
                  "commands": [
                    {"code": 101, "indent": 1, "parameters": ["Every city has its arrangements."]},
                    {"code": 401, "indent": 1, "parameters": ["Celadon's are simply more..."]},
                    {"code": 401, "indent": 1, "parameters": ["refined. Do you understand?"]},
                    {"code": 102, "indent": 1, "parameters": [["I understand.", "The Game Corner is a front.", "It's not my business."], 0]},
                    {"code": 402, "indent": 1, "parameters": [0, "I understand."]},
                    {"code": 122, "indent": 2, "parameters": [344, 344, 0, 0, 1]},
                    {"code": 121, "indent": 2, "parameters": [1147, 1147, 0]},
                    {"code": 101, "indent": 2, "parameters": ["Good. Wisdom is knowing when"]},
                    {"code": 401, "indent": 2, "parameters": ["to look and when to let the"]},
                    {"code": 401, "indent": 2, "parameters": ["garden grow in peace."]},
                    {"code": 402, "indent": 1, "parameters": [1, "The Game Corner is a front."]},
                    {"code": 122, "indent": 2, "parameters": [344, 344, 0, 0, 2]},
                    {"code": 121, "indent": 2, "parameters": [1148, 1148, 0]},
                    {"code": 101, "indent": 2, "parameters": ["...You sound like Misty. She"]},
                    {"code": 401, "indent": 2, "parameters": ["thinks honesty is the same as"]},
                    {"code": 401, "indent": 2, "parameters": ["progress. It isn't."]},
                    {"code": 101, "indent": 2, "parameters": ["But I admire the impulse."]},
                    {"code": 402, "indent": 1, "parameters": [2, "It's not my business."]},
                    {"code": 122, "indent": 2, "parameters": [344, 344, 0, 0, 3]},
                    {"code": 121, "indent": 2, "parameters": [1149, 1149, 0]},
                    {"code": 101, "indent": 2, "parameters": ["Exactly. That is the most"]},
                    {"code": 401, "indent": 2, "parameters": ["Celadon answer you could give."]},
                    {"code": 101, "indent": 2, "parameters": ["You'll fit right in. Whether"]},
                    {"code": 401, "indent": 2, "parameters": ["that's a compliment is up"]},
                    {"code": 401, "indent": 2, "parameters": ["to you."]},
                    {"code": 404, "indent": 1, "parameters": []}
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 52,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Come back when you are ready",
                    "to challenge me. The garden",
                    "will be here. It always is."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "1": {
              "conditions": {"switch1_id": 7},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 2,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "The garden grows, \\PN. With or",
                    "without our approval. That is",
                    "the nature of things."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "405": {
      "name": "Game Corner",
      "events": {
        "39": {
          "name": "EV039 (Greeter)",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Welcome to the Rocket Game",
                    "Corner! Best odds in Kanto.",
                    "Don't overthink the name."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 3,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Exchange coins for prizes",
                    "next door. All above board.",
                    "Mostly."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "23": {
          "name": "EV023 (Gambler -- Machine Luck)",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Some machines pay out better",
                    "than others. Almost like",
                    "someone's deciding who wins."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 3,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "But that's just superstition.",
                    "Probably."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "24": {
          "name": "EV024 (Gambler -- Sunk Cost)",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I've put so much money in at",
                    "this point... stopping now",
                    "would mean it was all wasted.",
                    "So I keep going. Makes sense."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "41": {
          "name": "EV041 (Gambler -- Philosophy)",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "You gotta spend money to make",
                    "money. That's what the guys",
                    "who run this place say. The",
                    "guys in the suits, I mean."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "8": {
          "name": "EV008 (Gambler -- Lucky)",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Luck's on my side today! Won",
                    "big. Don't ask me where the",
                    "prize Pok\u00e9mon come from."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "25": {
          "name": "EV025 (Gambler -- Addiction Warning)",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Gambling is fun. And addictive.",
                    "Kind of like not asking",
                    "questions in this town."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "35": {
          "name": "EV035 (Suspicious Man -- Poster Guard)",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Don't touch that poster. There",
                    "is absolutely no secret switch",
                    "behind it. Why would there be?"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "1": {
              "conditions": {"switch1_id": 143},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I told you! Nothing behind",
                    "that poster! You're very",
                    "curious for a tourist."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 3,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I'd stay on this floor",
                    "if I were you."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "2": {
              "conditions": {"switch1_id": 143, "switch2_id": 149},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
